{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20252","headline":"吊卢殷 六 · 孟郊","name":"吊卢殷 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耳闻陋巷生，眼见鲁山君。\n饿死始有名，饿名高氛氲。\n戆叟老壮气，感之爲忧云。\n所忧唯一泣，古今相纷纷。\n平生与君说，逮此俱云云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}